<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Dec 19.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Dec 19.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in Belarus and central Russian regions may be closed on December 19 due to snow storms and strong winds, the Russian Weather Service said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
